LAD'23 - Lustre Administrators and Developers Workshop

October 04-06, 2023
Face-to-Face event, Bordeaux, France

The Lustre Administrators & Developers workshop is a great opportunity for =
worldwide Lustre administrators and developers to gather and exchange their=
 experiences, developments, tools, best practices and more.

After 2 years of virtual LADs and an hybrid LAD'22 in Paris last year, we a=
re happy to announce that we will be able to welcome you again this year fo=
r this LAD'23 edition!
This will be a face-to-face event in Bordeaux on the 5th and 6th of October=
 2023, preceded by the Lustre's developer summit on the 4th of October, an =
invitation-only event for developers to exchange about the future of Lustre=
.

Save the date, and keep updated of the upcoming call for presentations and =
the opening of registrations!

Best regards,
The LAD organization team

Web site:
https://www.eofs.eu/events/lad23


[cid:d154caa1-e21b-4686-bbf8-1a0530ac42df]


